---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { NAVIDAD } from "../../config/navidad";
---

<section id="grupo-whatsapp" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#128C7E] via-[#1aa968] to-[#25D366] py-16 text-white md:py-20">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div>
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-20 -left-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/20 blur-2xl"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-6 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto]">
    <div class="reveal reveal-zoom mx-auto flex h-28 w-28 items-center justify-center rounded-[32px] bg-white text-[#25D366] shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-950/30 [transform:perspective(500px)_rotateY(-14deg)_rotateX(6deg)]">
      <Icon name="simple-icons:whatsapp" class="h-16 w-16" />
    </div>
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <h2 class="reveal font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-4xl">Únete al grupo de WhatsApp de la comunidad</h2>
      <p class="reveal mt-3 max-w-xl text-emerald-50" style="--reveal-delay:100ms">
        Es el paso que completa tu participación. Ahí anunciamos el sorteo en vivo, publicamos la lista de ganadores y compartimos contenido académico gratuito.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href={NAVIDAD.grupoWhatsApp} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-wa-grupo class="reveal group mx-auto inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 font-display text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#128C7E] shadow-xl shadow-emerald-950/30 transition hover:-translate-y-1" style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
      <Icon name="simple-icons:whatsapp" class="h-6 w-6" /> Unirme ahora
      <Icon name="lucide:arrow-right" class="h-5 w-5 transition group-hover:translate-x-1" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
